ersion (e.g., `v19.0` as of early 2024). Check Meta\u0027s documentation for the latest.\n*   **Privacy and Consent:** Ensure you comply with all relevant privacy regulations (GDPR, CCPA, etc.) regarding user data collection and consent for tracking.\n\nThis should give you a solid foundation for implementing Meta Conversions API. Always refer to the [official Meta Conversions API documentation](https://developers.facebook.com/docs/marketing-api/conversions-api) for the most up-to-date information and best practices.",
